  "title": "Babcock & Wilcox Signs Agreement with Siemens Energy to Commence Work on 20 Steam Turbines for Data Center Power Generation",
  "summary": "B&amp;W announced today that it has signed an agreement with Siemens Energy to commence work on 20 Siemens Energy steam turbine generator sets totaling 1 gigawatt of generating capacity for use in its FastPower℠ program for data center projects. This agreement is in addition to B&amp;W’s previously announced turbine order.",
